# The build context for box/Dockerfile (Docker reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# in place of the root .dockerignore, which keeps only runner/). The image
# copies box/bin, box/etc, box/deps and box/wallpapers; nothing else from the
# repository is needed, and nothing else is sent.
*
!box/bin
!box/etc
!box/deps/package.json
!box/deps/package-lock.json
!box/wallpapers
